      "content": "but i dont feel like a \"worthy traveler.\" i just feel like a joke. everything i was supposed to be is gone. it's like the fundamental logic of my life has just broken. how am i supposed to just \"reach out\" and pretend i'm a person when the thing that made me a person is dead? it feels like there's no point in even trying to rebuild when the foundation is just gone.",
